{"id": "21-240-2-8", "zh": "日月的晕称为 paridhi、parivesa；阳焰称为 marīci、migataṇhikā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-241-2-10", "zh": "太阳升起之前先出现的光芒，称为 aruṇa（曙光）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-243-2-7", "zh": "时间：kāla、addhā、samaya、velā，", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-244-2-4", "zh": "时间的细分是刹那（khaṇa）等；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-245-2-4", "zh": "十弹指的时间是一刹那，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-246-2-6", "zh": "十刹那为一 laya。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-248-2-5", "zh": "十 laya 为一 khaṇalaya，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-249-2-6", "zh": "十 khaṇalaya 为一须臾（muhutta）；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-250-2-10", "zh": "十须臾为一 khaṇamuhutta；白天：divasa、aha、dina。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-252-2-8", "zh": "清晨：pabhāta、vibhāta、paccūsa、kalla；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-253-2-5", "zh": "入夜时分：abhidosa、padosa；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-254-2-5", "zh": "黄昏：sāya、sañjhā、dinaccaya。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-256-2-10", "zh": "夜晚：nisā、rajanī、ratti、tiyāmā、saṃvarī；", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "21-257-2-8", "zh": "有月光的夜晚称为 juṇhā，黑暗浓重的夜晚称为 timisikā。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-259-2-8", "zh": "中夜：nisītha、majjhimā ratti、aḍḍharatta、mahānisā；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-260-2-9", "zh": "黑暗：andhakāra、tama（不用阴性）、timisa、timira。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-262-2-6", "zh": "所谓四重黑暗是这样的：黑分的第十四日、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-263-2-11", "zh": "茂密的丛林、浓厚的云层，以及半夜。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-265-2-10", "zh": "浓重的黑暗称为 andhatama；更次称为 pahāra，又称 yāma；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-266-2-23", "zh": "初一（pāṭipada）、初二（dutiyā）、初三（tatiyā）等是太阴日（tithi）；因为“守护、保护”，所以叫做 tithi，由 tā 加 iti 构成（属 ṇvādi 词缀类），用于两种性。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-268-2-8", "zh": "第十五日：pannarasī、pañcadasī；满月日：puṇṇamāsī、puṇṇamā；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-269-2-9", "zh": "另一个第十五日（新月日）称为 amāvasī、amāvāsī，用阴性。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-271-2-12", "zh": "六十个 ghaṭikā 为一昼夜（ahoratta），十五个昼夜为半月（pakkha）；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-272-2-6", "zh": "前后两个半月，分别是白分（sukka）", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-273-2-8", "zh": "与黑分（kāḷa）；两个半月合为一个月（māsa）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-275-2-12", "zh": "月份有：Citta 月、Vesākha 月、Jeṭṭha 月、Āsāḷha 月、Sāvaṇa 月（这两个用于两种性）；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-276-2-10", "zh": "Poṭṭhapāda 月、Assayuja 月、Kattika 月——这些是十二个月的名称；", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "21-278-2-9", "zh": "还有 Māgasira 月、Phussa 月，以及依次而来的 Māgha 月、Phagguṇa 月；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-279-2-9", "zh": "Kattika 月与 Assayuja 月，又分别称为后迦提月（pacchimakattika）与前迦提月（pubbakattika）。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-281-2-4", "zh": "Sāvaṇa 月又称为 nikkhamanīya，", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-282-2-5", "zh": "Citta 月则称为 rammaka。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-284-2-7", "zh": "从 Kattika 月的黑分算起，每四个月为一季，", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-285-2-9", "zh": "依次是冬季（hemanta）、夏季（gimhāna）、雨季（vassāna）；季节（utu）一词用于两种性。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-287-2-5", "zh": "或者季节分为冬季（hemanta）、寒季（sisira）、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-288-2-8", "zh": "春季（vasanta）、夏季（gimha）、雨季（vassāna）", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-289-2-10", "zh": "和**秋季**（sarada）六季，按照前面所说的月份顺序，每季依次各占两个月。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-291-2-5", "zh": "夏季：uṇha、nidāgha、gimha；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-292-2-5", "zh": "雨季：vassa、vassāna、pāvusa；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-293-2-8", "zh": "从雨季开始的三个季节，称为南行期（dakkhiṇāyana）；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-295-2-7", "zh": "其余三个季节称为北行期（uttarāyana）；两个行期合为一年。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-296-2-9", "zh": "年：vassa、saṃvacchara（不用阴性）、sarada、hāyana，都是同义词。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-298-2-9", "zh": "劫的毁灭：kappakkhaya、saṃvaṭṭa、yuganta、palaya；", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-299-2-10", "zh": "厄运女神：alakkhī、kālakaṇṇī，用阴性；吉祥女神：lakkhī、sirī，用阴性。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "21-301-2-10", "zh": "檀那婆（dānava）的母亲是 Danu，诸天的母亲则是 Aditi；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-303-2-9", "zh": "恶：pāpa、kibbisa、vera、agha、duccarita、dukkaṭa、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-304-2-12", "zh": "apuñña、akusala、kaṇha、kalusa、durita、āgu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-306-2-10", "zh": "善：kusala、sukata、sukka、puñña、dhamma（不用阴性）、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-307-2-8", "zh": "sucarita；现世的：diṭṭhadhammika、ihalokika、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-309-2-8", "zh": "sandiṭṭhika；来世的：pāralokika、samparāyika；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-310-2-6", "zh": "当时：takkāla、tadātva；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-311-2-5", "zh": "未来（uttarakāla）称为 āyati。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-313-2-11", "zh": "喜：hāsa、attamanatā、pīti、vitti、tuṭṭhi（用阴性）、", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-314-2-10", "zh": "ānanda、pamudā、āmoda、santosa、nandi、sammada、", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "21-316-2-11", "zh": "pāmojja、pamoda；乐：sukha、sāta、phāsu；", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "21-317-2-10", "zh": "吉祥、美好：bhadda、seyya、subha、khema、kalyāṇa、maṅgala、siva。", "confidence": 75}
